terminating their employment.

00:48:36.713 --> 00:48:38.215
They're gonna make
an example of them.

00:48:38.215 --> 00:48:41.084
Of course, that's how they
kept everybody else in line.

00:48:41.084 --> 00:48:42.519
I'm sympathetic with that.

00:48:42.519 --> 00:48:46.790 align:start size:97% position:3%
Doctors, they spend a
decade plus getting trained,

00:48:46.790 --> 00:48:48.292
