00:48:48.292 --> 00:48:51.428
They've got $300,000 worth
of student loans to pay off.

00:48:51.428 --> 00:48:52.629
They have to make a living,

00:48:52.629 --> 00:48:55.032
plus they want to be
doctors to help people.

00:48:55.032 --> 00:48:57.000
They just couldn't
step out of line,

00:48:57.000 --> 00:49:00.103
